Subject: [PATCH 31/31] Lapin UX: Home, Network and Recycle Bin in the new
 design
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Refs #143. Home's headings look like the group headings elsewhere (accent
text, chevron, line), Quick access uses the full-colour folder icons, and
Favorites and Recent are lists with Name, Date accessed and File location
columns. Home and This PC set the tab's name and icon. The Network page is
called Networks (not network:///). Empty trash and Add network drive move from
the bar under the files to the "…" menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CkhomYUp7uVySJk724Amq
